=== Audit: NetworkAgent concurrency contract ===

  validator_count after 8x50 concurrent joins (Mutex-serialised) = 400
  engine.distinction_count = 1228
  engine.relationship_count = 2453
  r=2d-3 numerically? true

  OBSERVATION: NetworkAgent is &mut self everywhere. There is NO
  built-in Mutex/RwLock. The above test only works because we wrap
  the agent ourselves. Embedders MUST do this. Nothing in network.rs
  enforces or documents the requirement.
  VERDICT: agent is single-writer by construction, advertised as
           network consensus. SEVERITY: MEDIUM (footgun / doc gap).
